### 查询全部学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### 根据 id 查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

### 添加学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10",
  "name": "测试学生",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}

### 修改学生
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10",
  "name": "测试学生修改版",
  "age": 21,
  "score": 90
}

### 删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/10

### 条件查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/condition?name=张&minScore=60&maxScore=100

### 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&pageSize=3

### 条件分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page/condition?page=1&pageSize=3&name=张&minScore=60&maxScore=100